      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — breaking the method chain into named steps and removing unused imports/fields.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version breaks the chained method calls into two named intermediate variables (`featuresWithEnabled` and `featuresAfterDisable`), adds a descriptive assertion message clarifying why `Boolean.FALSE` is expected rather than `null`, and removes the unused `EMPTY` field and unused imports (`Shape`, `DEFAULT_RADIX`)."
